sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as StudyWindow
    participant F as StudyFacade
    participant S as SchedulingStrategy
    participant B as PlanBuilder
    participant R as PropertiesRepository
    participant E as EventBus
    participant L as ActivityLog
    Student->>UI: Select strategy and generate(name, budget)
    UI->>F: generate(name, budget, strategy)
    F->>S: order(tasks)
    S-->>F: unfinished tasks in selected order
    F->>B: named / configured / add sessions
    F->>B: build()
    B-->>F: validated immutable Plan
    F->>R: save(next snapshot)
    alt write succeeds
        R-->>F: success
        Note over F: replace in-memory state
        F->>E: publish(generated)
        E->>L: accept(event)
        E->>UI: refresh and status
        F-->>UI: saved Plan
        UI-->>Student: sessions and export preview
    else write fails
        R-->>F: IOException
        F-->>UI: error; previous state preserved
        UI-->>Student: error dialog; no success event
    end
